              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 4,
              "perItem": true,
              "source": "[PAUSE 4s each]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say the Punjabi for unripe, stale, then ripe. Only after all three, hear the answers: ਕੱਚਾ, ਬੇਹਾ, ਪੱਕਾ. If one slipped, revisit that earlier quality word."
            }
